    "title": "Matt Pocock 的 AI 开发工作流：从“Grill”到“Retro”的全程解析",
    "published_at": "2026-10-15T13:43:19.306473178Z",
    "sections": [
      {
        "id": "sec_intro",
        "title": "引言：沉默的猜测与咖啡时间",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "marks": [],
                "text": "想象一下，你只需输入一句“让用户暂停订阅”，AI Agent 就能在你冲咖啡的短短几分钟内完成功能开发、通过测试并交付代码。这听起来很美好，但随之而来的是“沉默的猜测”：Agent 自行决定了账单何时停止、已打包的商品如何处理，甚至提醒邮件的措辞。",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "citation_id": "cit_transcript_0",
                "type": "citation"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block_intro_1",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "caption": "视频开篇展示了 Agent 在 9 分钟内完成“暂停订阅”功能的场景，标题为“THE SILENT GUESS”（沉默的猜测）。",
            "citation_ids": [
              "cit_frame_1"
            ],
            "frame_ids": [
              "workflow-frame-01"
            ],
            "id": "block_intro_figure",
            "layout": "single",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "figure"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "sec_grill",
        "title": "Grill：驱散决策迷雾",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Matt Pocock 提出的解决方案是“Grill”技能——一种无情的访谈机制。它将功能视为一棵决策树，在“迷雾”中找出所有尚未确定的子决策（如计费方式、已打包商品处理、暂停时长），并向开发者逐一提问。",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "citation_id": "cit_transcript_1",
                "type": "citation"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block_grill_concept",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "caption": "“The Fog”可视化：灰色云雾代表未决定的决策，白色椭圆代表已确定的“墨水”决策。随着问答进行，迷雾逐渐消散。",
            "citation_ids": [
              "cit_frame_2"
            ],
            "frame_ids": [
              "workflow-frame-02"
            ],
            "id": "block_grill_figure",
            "layout": "single",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "figure"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "marks": [],
                "text": "这种提问可能非常密集。在一次课程录制中，Agent 向 Matt 提出了 46 个问题，以至于他开玩笑说：“哥们，冷静点，你把新手都吓跑了。”每个问题都附带推荐答案，开发者只需确认或修正，从而高效地填满决策树的空白。",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "citation_id": "cit_transcript_2",
                "type": "citation"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block_grill_questions",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "caption": "Matt Pocock 的推文截图，显示 Agent 在一次课程中提出了 46 个问题，引发幽默回应。",
            "citation_ids": [
              "cit_frame_3"
            ],
            "frame_ids": [
              "workflow-frame-03"
            ],
            "id": "block_grill_figure_2",
            "layout": "single",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "figure"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "sec_glossary",
        "title": "术语表与 /wait-what：统一语言",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "marks": [],
                "text": "为了避免 Agent 使用模糊或错误的术语，工作流中引入了项目术语表（Glossary）。例如，明确区分“Pause”（无配送、无扣费）和“Skip”（错过配送、计费继续）。当 Agent 使用晦涩语言时，开发者可以使用“/wait-what”技能，强制其用通俗语言和标准术语重新解释。",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "citation_id": "cit_transcript_3",
                "type": "citation"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block_glossary",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "caption": "“SAY IT ONCE”：展示 Glossary.md 文件定义及 /wait-what 技能的作用，确保沟通一致性。",
            "citation_ids": [
              "cit_frame_4"
            ],
            "frame_ids": [
              "workflow-frame-04"
            ],
            "id": "block_glossary_figure",
            "layout": "single",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "figure"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "sec_spec_tickets",
        "title": "Spec 与 Tickets：智能区内的清洁头脑",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "marks": [],
                "text": "决策确定后，Agent 生成包含详细用户故事（User Stories）的 Spec，并作为 Issue 标记为“Ready for Agent”。为了保持 Agent 在“智能区”（Smart Zone，约 150k token 以内）的高效推理，大任务被拆分为多个小 Ticket。",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "citation_id": "cit_transcript_4",
                "type": "citation"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block_spec",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "caption": "“THE DESTINATION”：Spec 转化为带有用户故事的 Issue，并明确“Seam”（切入点）以便测试。",
            "citation_ids": [
              "cit_frame_5"
            ],
            "frame_ids": [
              "workflow-frame-05"
            ],
            "id": "block_spec_figure",
            "layout": "single",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "figure"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "marks": [],
                "text": "采用“Clean Heads”策略：每完成一个 Ticket 就清空聊天上下文，确保下一个任务从零开始，避免上下文污染和推理能力下降。",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "citation_id": "cit_transcript_5",
                "type": "citation"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block_tickets",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "caption": "“CLEAN HEADS”：展示 150k Token 的 Smart Zone 限制及 Ticket 拆分逻辑。",
            "citation_ids": [
              "cit_frame_6"
            ],
            "frame_ids": [
              "workflow-frame-06"
            ],
            "id": "block_tickets_figure",
            "layout": "single",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "figure"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "sec_review_pr",
        "title": "双桌审查与 Merge Danger",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "marks": [],
                "text": "代码审查采用“Two Desks”模式：一个 Agent 对照 Spec 检查功能完整性，另一个 Agent 对照编码标准检查代码质量。这种分离确保了审查的专注性。",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "citation_id": "cit_transcript_6",
                "type": "citation"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block_review",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "caption": "“TWO DESKS”：两个 Agent 分别负责 Spec 对照和 Standards 对照的代码审查。",
            "citation_ids": [
              "cit_frame_7"
            ],
            "frame_ids": [
              "workflow-frame-07"
            ],
            "id": "block_review_figure",
            "layout": "single",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "figure"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "marks": [],
                "text": "PR 描述由 Agent 自动生成，包含“Merge Danger”评估，指出更改是“双向门”（可逆）还是“单向门”，以及“Blast Radius”（波及范围），帮助人类快速识别风险。",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "citation_id": "cit_transcript_7",
                "type": "citation"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block_pr",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "caption": "“MERGE DANGER”：PR 描述中包含 Door 类型和 Blast Radius 评估，此处波及范围为 Billing 模块。",
            "citation_ids": [
              "cit_frame_8"
            ],
            "frame_ids": [
              "workflow-frame-08"
            ],
            "id": "block_pr_figure",
            "layout": "single",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "figure"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "sec_retro",
        "title": "Retro：持续改进的工程规范",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "marks": [],
                "text": "任务完成后，使用“/retro”技能回顾会话，Agent 会建议更新文档、添加 Lint 规则或预提交钩子，将本次遇到的痛点转化为长期规范。Matt 强调不应自动应用这些修复，以免 Agent 陷入误报循环，人类需介入筛选。",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "citation_id": "cit_transcript_8",
                "type": "citation"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block_retro",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "caption": "“/RETRO”：Agent 回顾会话并提出改进建议，如添加 Lint 规则或更新 AGENTS.md。",
            "citation_ids": [
              "cit_frame_9"
            ],
            "frame_ids": [
              "workflow-frame-09"
            ],
            "id": "block_retro_figure",
            "layout": "single",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "figure"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "sec_philosophy",
        "title": "哲学：将军与战术家",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "marks": [],
                "text": "尽管该工作流（Grill -> Spec -> Tickets -> Build）看似瀑布流，但 Matt 引用 Uncle Bob 的观点为其辩护，认为在 AI 时代这种结构化方法能有效控制复杂性。整个技能集合仅占用 660 tokens，其中大部分按需调用，并不增加日常认知负荷。",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "citation_id": "cit_transcript_9",
                "type": "citation"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block_waterfall",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "caption": "“WATERFALL?”：阶梯图展示工作流阶段，并引用 Uncle Bob 直播内容回应质疑。",
            "citation_ids": [
              "cit_frame_10"
            ],
            "frame_ids": [
              "workflow-frame-10"
            ],
            "id": "block_waterfall_figure",
            "layout": "single",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "figure"
          },
          {
            "caption": "“TOO DEFENSIVE?”：展示技能集合构成，总占用仅 660 tokens。",
            "citation_ids": [
              "cit_frame_11"
            ],
            "frame_ids": [
              "workflow-frame-11"
            ],
            "id": "block_skills_figure",
            "layout": "single",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "figure"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "marks": [],
                "text": "核心理念是：人类是“将军”（The General），负责战略决策；Agent 是“战术家”（Tactical），负责执行。通过明确的决策和结构化的工作流，人类驾驭 AI 的强大执行力，同时保留对业务逻辑的最终控制权。",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "citation_id": "cit_transcript_10",
                "type": "citation"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block_general",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "caption": "“THE GENERAL”：人类制定战略决策（如账单、商品处理），Agent 负责战术执行。",
            "citation_ids": [
              "cit_frame_12"
            ],
            "frame_ids": [
              "workflow-frame-12"
            ],
            "id": "block_general_figure",
            "layout": "single",
            "origin": "video",
            "type": "figure"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
